  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A spherical planet has a radius R<sub>0</sub>.</p>\n<p>The graph shows the variation of the gravitational potential due to the planet with distance r from the centre of the planet.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the escape speed from the surface of the planet?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">1.6 × 10<sup>3</sup> m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"B\">2.2 × 10<sup>3</sup> m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"C\">3.2 × 10<sup>3</sup> m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"D\">4.5 × 10<sup>3</sup> m s<sup>−1</sup></li></ol>"
  },
